@MapService_HostAddress = http://localhost:6205

### Route quote - cần Bearer token hợp lệ (role bất kỳ) hoặc header X-Internal-Key
POST {{MapService_HostAddress}}/api/map/route/quote
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer <token>

{
  "pickupLatitude": 10.776889,
  "pickupLongitude": 106.700806,
  "dropoffLatitude": 10.762622,
  "dropoffLongitude": 106.660172
}

### Route quote qua internal key (OrderService/DeliveryService gọi)
POST {{MapService_HostAddress}}/api/map/route/quote
Content-Type: application/json
X-Internal-Key: dev-only-internal-key-change-me

{
  "pickupLatitude": 10.776889,
  "pickupLongitude": 106.700806,
  "dropoffLatitude": 10.762622,
  "dropoffLongitude": 106.660172
}

### Toạ độ không hợp lệ -> 400 INVALID_COORDINATES
POST {{MapService_HostAddress}}/api/map/route/quote
Content-Type: application/json
X-Internal-Key: dev-only-internal-key-change-me

{
  "pickupLatitude": 999,
  "pickupLongitude": 106.700806,
  "dropoffLatitude": 10.762622,
  "dropoffLongitude": 106.660172
}

### Health
GET {{MapService_HostAddress}}/health/live

###
GET {{MapService_HostAddress}}/health/ready
